# Prompt B (With Context)

## Prompt Used

You are a learning design specialist. Create a 30-day learning roadmap for a learner with the following context:

- Current Situation: Student
- Current Skills: Prompt Engineering, GitHub, Claude AI, AI Tools
- Goal: Become an AI Engineer and build a portfolio of AI projects
- Available Time: 2–3 Hours per Day
- Experience Level: Beginner
- Preferred Learning Style: Projects + Videos

The roadmap must include weekly milestones, daily tasks, resources, projects, and a final outcome. Use a practical and beginner-friendly tone. Tailor every element to the provided context.

